!/surya_pipeline/README.md
!/surya_pipeline/surya_heading_rules.md
!/surya_pipeline/docs/
!/surya_pipeline/docs/*.md

# Inputs / outputs (never commit)
/main_converter/raw_pptx/**
/main_converter/target_pptx/**
/main_converter/target_slides/**
/main_converter/output/**
/surya_pipeline/target_pptx/**
